{"unit_id":"alanhaskey__dsh-gitmate#card-zh","repo":"alanhaskey/dsh-gitmate","commit":"fd0b69db44dbbe371c214c841f59325f447173ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"GitMate 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Git 侧栏和 agent 工具集。它在右侧栏注册面板，并通过 Host 端共享实现提供 Git 操作。用户可以查看状态和差异、暂存与提交、管理分支和远程同步，也可让当前模型生成或优化提交说明、审阅暂存改动并拆分提交。适合在 DSH 会话中直接处理项目版本控制和代码变更审阅。需要本机可用的 Git；模型辅助功能使用会话默认模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:14","lib/client.js:3988","lib/impl.js:775"]}
{"unit_id":"alanhaskey__dsh-gitmate#card-en","repo":"alanhaskey/dsh-gitmate","commit":"fd0b69db44dbbe371c214c841f59325f447173ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"GitMate adds a Git panel to the DSH web sidebar and provides agent tools for status, diffs, staging, commits, branches, and remote sync. It also uses the session model to generate commit messages, review staged changes, and suggest commit splits. Requires local Git.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:14","lib/client.js:3988","lib/impl.js:775"]}
